    "description": "The Event Ticketing Waitlist API allows users to access and retrieve information about tickets that are currently on the waitlist for various events. This endpoint provides a comprehensive list of waitlisted tickets, helping event organizers and ticketing managers track demand and availability. It is particularly useful for businesses in the events management sector looking to optimize ticket distribution. Developers can use this API to enhance user experience by providing real-time updates on ticket availabilities to their customers.",
